{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0fa384db47e6794df9bb351d1b43ced8209eba9941c488dcb6886b272752e3c0", "ja": "お疲れさま。\n恵美、ここにいたのか。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n惠美，原来你在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "5499d61c6af3cb08e02bbb73364d8f560a50b89634d60c49da3258d4c0b17c74", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ～。\nあれ、千早とあずさも一緒？　なんか新しい仕事？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦～\n咦，千早和阿梓也在一起？难道是接到了什么新工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "95c12ee03964bcb13fb43e0ea9e01f1e1261cdf5440cf18f6e3d33d6b5e8772e", "ja": "私たちは、仕事というか付き添いみたいなの♪", "zh": "我们嘛，与其说是工作，更像是陪同来的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "a38848e1d32951f936257c81ceca157594509d0d059137b8b5588362e8cf2052", "ja": "でも所さんは、そういうことみたい。", "zh": "不过所小姐，好像就是这种情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "08897a4f836bd9a4347634dac768f4eb6016fca8144797627af4f3392ef94ed5", "ja": "え？　つまり……どゆコト？", "zh": "诶？也就是说……什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7ddd70be80ab1e9af4511e0eb44b449c05424dd9ee46800588aa52a656004a43", "ja": "つまり……恵美、『フューチャーオーディション』て\n番組のこと、知ってるか？", "zh": "也就是说……惠美，你知道《Future Audition》这个节目吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "2271bdb354e5693f19d212b8a38b8994ee9159b5bfd3816e5304a10d0ded3ce7", "ja": "あ、知ってます！　いろんな音楽レーベルのスカウトが\n出る、新人アイドルのオーディション番組ですよね！", "zh": "啊，我知道！是会有各大音乐唱片公司的星探参加的新人偶像选秀节目，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "977ea837a64d2af40103c153fd8eca85c81dd32574755791e02e645958a88459", "ja": "審査員が音楽プロデューサーさんとか作曲家さんで、\nたまに現役のアイドルもゲストに呼ばれてて。", "zh": "评委是音乐制作人和作曲家，\n偶尔也会请现役偶像来当嘉宾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "37849755bf7f38fe6367c188c1ffbe6f8dea78bcfbd035559fb8531b59eb4ac2", "ja": "あー、そういえば聞いたことあるかも……？\nてか紗代子、そういうのほんと詳しいよね。", "zh": "啊～这么说来，我好像听过……？\n话说纱代子，你对这种事真的很清楚呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "a1a4b8ba0af0c37f9b3d3a817cd33e00c15c98ea2473ce0cdfc9477553f4716f", "ja": "広告が載ってると、つい見ちゃうんだ。\nアイドル雑誌でも、よく参加者を募集してるの。", "zh": "刊登了广告的话，就会忍不住去看呢。\n偶像杂志上也经常会招募参加者哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2e7953835c9b364b6d5fbde5d5a30563963bd510186a89b6390271afd5e4b532", "ja": "そのゲスト審査員の枠にうちの事務所が入ることに\nなって。それを恵美にやってもらいたいんだ。", "zh": "我们事务所要负责担任那个特邀评委。我想让惠美来做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "128534a77af91a02ca5ce9e69ebe1d331889b942deebde8c9453233a55006063", "ja": "ええっ！？　ちょ、アタシが？　なんで！？", "zh": "诶！？等等，为什么是我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1012_p", "source_sha256": "657eda47e6e35567a4f111bb80a177d43263233ca9722b428aa0afe2f40ccc43", "ja": "それは、俺が推薦したからだ。", "zh": "因为是我推荐的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "0a1108835db06c0c0d288b4330057d1f92748d40d100ba6ea393ab99e5a1db3b", "ja": "だからなんでー！？　ムリムリムリ！\n審査員って、歌とか審査するんだよね？", "zh": "所以为什么啊——！？不行不行不行！\n评委不是要评判唱歌之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "4f14f3eda9d1e2f70c74276b76d58bfbdc541d201f6bdb52d24699f32f568af1", "ja": "千早とか歌織のほうが絶対いいじゃん！　歌うまいし、\nかしこいし！　アタシはそういうの向いてないって！", "zh": "千早和歌织绝对更合适吧！唱歌又好听，人又聪明！我就不适合这种事啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1015_p", "source_sha256": "52665c5548f5719dfb8dcd7f46e0719461cc0773e3818d71444d2086ef5c0fd9", "ja": "でも恵美は、じつは周りをよく見てると思うんだ。\nその長所を活かして欲しい。", "zh": "不过，我觉得惠美其实很善于观察周围的人。希望你能发挥这一优点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "2aed3ee1c3d8c651022cf6f7b36c37cbbf297cf054197b404a4fa467647f7211", "ja": "そうですね。恵美ちゃんて、\n誰かが困ってると、すぐ気がついてくれますし。", "zh": "是啊。惠美她呀，只要有人遇到困难，就会马上察觉到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e1dba6dce2b63e7675f9c0dcbce8d863430ee9204bdf0ba86ccfc8529dc8d6c9", "ja": "で、ひとりじゃ心細いだろうから、この新曲公演の\nメンバーにも付き添ってもらえたらと思ってる。", "zh": "而且，一个人应该会不安，所以我想请她陪着这次新歌公演的成员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "78ad4088dcdae68aec0c50c088b001cb2870a74fb83a5fe8b55f3fd6e841e526", "ja": "わかりました。私は全然大丈夫です！", "zh": "明白了。我完全没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "49f734b169226c72fb3f2978faaa1f0af9d321c6c0cc8cc9589d0b367810aa98", "ja": "いやアタシは大丈夫じゃないんだけど！？", "zh": "可我一点都不好啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "66fa5f53adcf93deae04cabcb15d7c47630074b684771ac40ca0e1b71e2bc763", "ja": "所さんは、人を褒めるのも上手だから。\nそういう意味では、私も向いていると思うわ。", "zh": "因为所同学很擅长夸奖别人。\n从这个意义上来说，我也觉得自己挺适合的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "1fa08ab1056308c87aa5eb13d60c394520a46eb8de104ef9701a87945d8e83cd", "ja": "う。そりゃ、褒めるのは得意な気がするけどぉ……。", "zh": "嗯。夸人我倒是挺擅长的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b35b136918b23e869ef30bf5b1594c7e7bbad6186350b9d1d09fb0f40a26d352", "ja": "新曲公演の準備と並行になるし、いろいろ大変だとも\n思う。でも、だからこそ、挑戦してみて欲しいんだ。", "zh": "还要和新歌公演的准备工作同时进行，我也觉得会很辛苦。不过，正因为如此，我才希望你能试着挑战一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1023_p", "source_sha256": "73fee05149146a02b2abf159173f3168eb788df66ef908485c94bc1530fe5a38", "ja": "恵美がアイドルとして、\n次のステップに進むために。", "zh": "为了让惠美作为偶像，迈向下一个阶段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "2e8ba5c6d5210678da00cef7cbc6ed39d4e2ef68ce12f6a8d47c8697b74e83c1", "ja": "う……。\nそういうこと言われちゃうと……。", "zh": "呜……\n你都这么说了的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "31180445fc11103a79547b030873e5c53d502a29294e293d64251decbe6083d9", "ja": "ああもう、わかった。やってみるよ！\n新曲公演もあるし、アタシもアイドル、もっと頑張る！", "zh": "啊真是的，知道了。我试试看！\n还有新歌公演，我也要更加努力做好偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e5c49ff79f55df77c722597c8d2f465531c3ff28afa847376e8400457f4daa22", "ja": "おお、よかった！\nそれじゃ、よろしく頼むな。", "zh": "哦，那太好了！\n那就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1027_p", "source_sha256": "620b0a32f7019933dfacff69a5bd3317cf0ceab39aff082bb329b22801d69a63", "ja": "書類選考はもう済んでて、恵美には実技審査から入って\nもらうことになる。資料が来たらすぐに渡すから。", "zh": "书面审查已经通过了，惠美要从实技考核开始参加。资料一到我就马上给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "b816e03db0b9f451fa07c50722a5684c7bfcb9bd624ec9f53d68232491f7e7ee", "ja": "うわ～。やっぱ超難しそう……。\nま、いざとなれば千早に相談すればいっか！　ねっ？", "zh": "哇～。果然看起来超难……\n不过，真到了紧要关头找千早商量就行了吧！对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "ed5cc45c2c0a083d0798b1cb3e501b307d22254a1d4577b35b76502992d2e26c", "ja": "……感想ぐらいなら。\nでも、最後は所さんが自分で決めないと。", "zh": "……如果只是感想的话。\n但是，最后还是得由所同学你自己来决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "1a071f86601e2ba57e85acdaa9d67e24c37f2485f8ec90f8d7379dec723d07c7", "ja": "え。じ、じゃあ、歌織とかあずさとかに……。", "zh": "诶。那、那就去问歌织啊、梓啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "1c90f9ffabcd8a98c40e3fd2c7cebfeaf4445cf3fb4967982feeaedd4d5194dd", "ja": "しりません♪", "zh": "不知道♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "a7f3ebe608250ba59a3b9f3238e63295e4c14ee003611dcdb4b0055af05cf4d3", "ja": "いけません♪", "zh": "不行哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "1df811faf8047413bcffbf0239a92a7d713a807aaa1d3ed381cb583d1786a0e0", "ja": "うわーん！　せめて紗代子が相談に乗って～！！", "zh": "呜哇——！至少纱代子你来听我商量嘛～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1034_027say", "source_sha256": "4f8eb220b75d712de71542526c538860ab3d0e373fcbbf19c48a40eca162feba", "ja": "うんっ、私は全力で応援するね！！", "zh": "嗯，我会全力为你加油的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_145_1035_020meg", "source_sha256": "0830169014be5fc41fbc533d2a854c6c0d55e2e465219a5061b99f9000e67b43", "ja": "わーん！\n審査員が応援されてる場合じゃないと思う！", "zh": "呜哇—！\n我觉得现在可不是评委被加油的时候吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
